{"3728650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super-B", "steam_appid": 3728650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Super-B, a colorful social playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends, decorate your own space, and dive into exciting games—just like hanging out at a theme park full of fun surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Social Activities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room with furniture and create your own personal space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends over, share quick co-op activities, or just have fun messing around with emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected by sending notes, writing guestbook messages, and even gifting items to friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. Match-Based Games</strong><br>Take on a wide variety of fast-paced game modes in real time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Defusal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacle Races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide &amp; Seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Random Weapon Challenge<br> …and many more to come through future updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/1e3d10bd590792faa975439724b59ab1.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/1e3d10bd590792faa975439724b59ab1.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/1e3d10bd590792faa975439724b59ab1.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>03. Character Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your creativity with over 1,000 parts and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mix and match outfits, hairstyles, hats, pets, and emotes to create a character that’s truly one of a kind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b969d3ef6cbbab6561b7b2d7c0f3b0a5.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=393 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>04. Endless Fun</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own space, hang out with friends, or climb the rankings in competitive matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether cooperating or competing, every play session brings fresh new experiences. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/82c44c300a8cd3c80c10c322b6c79b66.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Super-B, a colorful social playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends, decorate your own space, and dive into exciting games—just like hanging out at a theme park full of fun surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Social Activities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room with furniture and create your own personal space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends over, share quick co-op activities, or just have fun messing around with emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected by sending notes, writing guestbook messages, and even gifting items to friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. Match-Based Games</strong><br>Take on a wide variety of fast-paced game modes in real time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Defusal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacle Races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide &amp; Seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Random Weapon Challenge<br> …and many more to come through future updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"