/steam/apps/3728650/extras/82c44c300a8cd3c80c10c322b6c79b66.avif?t=1768202717\" width=700 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Super-B is a free-to-play multiplayer game with AAA 3D graphics, where players become toy characters in a brick-built world. It features 12+ game modes at launch, offering fast-paced action and social interaction.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/fe487ccb3fca3b3efb0422638df228afd20c4966/header.jpg?t=1768202717", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/1d7d7ed0d40ee6519f06ae5884549cd162947835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768202717", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/1d7d7ed0d40ee6519f06ae5884549cd162947835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768202717", "website": "https://play.super-b.io", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4400 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GT 730, AMD Radeon R7 250, Intel HD Graphics 530, or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4590 CPU, AMD Ryzen 3 3300X, or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 480, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060, or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requi